1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,917
What if your diary filled
itself, reminded every customer,

2
00:00:03,917 --> 00:00:07,157
and chased every no-show,
without you lifting a finger?

3
00:00:07,157 --> 00:00:07,981
Let's see how.

4
00:00:08,838 --> 00:00:10,638
This is your Kyntlo calendar.

5
00:00:10,638 --> 00:00:14,237
Every booking, for every member
of your team, in one view.

6
00:00:14,237 --> 00:00:15,416
Day, week or month.

7
00:00:16,268 --> 00:00:19,611
Customers book themselves
from a simple booking page,

8
00:00:19,611 --> 00:00:22,323
and only see times that
are genuinely free.

9
00:00:22,323 --> 00:00:26,675
Share the link on your website, in
emails, or on your Google profile.

10
00:00:27,528 --> 00:00:29,001
Then Kyntlo takes over.

11
00:00:29,001 --> 00:00:33,484
It confirms every booking, and sends
reminders before the appointment,

12
00:00:33,484 --> 00:00:35,597
by email and text, automatically.

13
00:00:36,455 --> 00:00:41,318
This calendar sends an email 24 hours
before, and a text 2 hours before.

14
00:00:41,318 --> 00:00:43,953
You choose the timing, and the message.

15
00:00:44,804 --> 00:00:49,122
And when someone doesn't turn up, your
team marks the appointment as a no-show,

16
00:00:49,122 --> 00:00:49,832
in one click.

17
00:00:50,684 --> 00:00:53,104
That starts a no-show recovery workflow.

18
00:00:53,104 --> 00:00:57,340
It waits 30 minutes, then sends a
friendly text with a link to rebook.

19
00:00:57,340 --> 00:01:01,939
And if they still haven't rebooked, it
creates a task for your team to call.

20
00:01:02,789 --> 00:01:05,673
Online booking comes
with every Kyntlo plan.

21
00:01:05,673 --> 00:01:09,475
Automatic reminders and no-show
workflows start on Growth.

22
00:01:10,326 --> 00:01:12,412
Let your calendar run itself.

23
00:01:12,412 --> 00:01:15,937
Start your free 14-day
trial today, at kyntlo.ai.
